Rule 1 (Input tensor must be at least 3D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3
>>
Rule 2 (Mask tensor must match the batch and time dimensions of the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 2 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_1, 0) ∧ shape(v_2, 1) = shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 3 (Mask tensor must be a boolean tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 0
>>
Rule 5 (The batch and temporal dimensions of the input tensor must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0
>>
Rule 8 (Input tensor must be at least 3-dimensional with positive dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 9 (Mask tensor must match the batch and time dimensions of the 3D+ input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) = shape(v_2, 0) ∧ shape(v_1, 1) = shape(v_2, 1)
>>
Rule 10 (Mask tensor must have a boolean, integer, or float data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 0 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 3 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7
>>
Rule 13 (All dimensions of the input tensor must be positive integers)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 14 (The input tensor must be at least 3-dimensional, with positive batch and time dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 15 (The total number of elements in the mask must equal the product of batch and time dimensions of the input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 2 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) * shape(v_2, 1) = shape(v_1, 0) * shape(v_1, 1)
>>
Rule 16 (The input tensor must be a 3D+ floating-point tensor)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 3 ∧ (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8)
